OL,5,G0930 Essential Classics
OL,6,     FGeorgia Mann plays the best in
OL,7,     Fclassical music, with discoveries
OL,8,     Fand surprises rubbing shoulders
OL,9,     Fwith familiar favourites.
OL,10,G1300 Classical Live
OL,11,     FElizabeth Alker introduces
OL,12,     Fhighlights from the Proms
OL,13,     Fincluding music by Schumann. From
OL,14,     FMecklenburg-Vorpommern Festival,
OL,15,     FBenjamin Appl performs Beethoven.
OL,16,G1600 Composer of the Week: Stephen
OL,17,G     Sondheim
OL,18,     F4/5. Donald Macleod reflects back
OL,19,     Fon the life and work of Titan of
OL,20,     FMusical Theatre Stephen Sondheim.
