OL,5,G0030 Through the Night
OL,6,     FFrench virtuoso pianist David Fray
OL,7,     Fperforms in Mozart's Piano
OL,8,     FConcerto No 20. Also, we hear the
OL,9,     FIrish premiere of Cindy McTee's
OL,10,     F'Timepiece' and Richard Strauss's
OL,11,     F'Ein Heldenleben'.
